---
// Request path vs control path (docs/architecture.md, docs/how-it-works.md §8).
// The controller is optional and never sits between your service and Redis.
---
<figure class="arch" aria-labelledby="arch-cap">
  <div class="arch-grid">
    <div class="arch-node arch-fleet">
      <p class="arch-kicker">Every instance of your service</p>
      <p class="arch-name">Your code + KeyShift SDK</p>
      <ul class="arch-parts">
        <li>detector</li><li>admission</li><li>local cache</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-link arch-req" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="arch-line arch-line-out"><em>reads &amp; writes</em></span>
      <span class="arch-line arch-line-in"><em>invalidations</em></span>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-node arch-redis">
      <p class="arch-kicker">Unchanged</p>
      <p class="arch-name">Redis</p>
      <p class="arch-foot">client tracking, RESP3</p>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-link arch-ctl" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="arch-vline"><em>telemetry<br />every ~30 s</em></span>
      <span class="arch-vline arch-vline-up"><em>policies</em></span>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-node arch-controller">
      <p class="arch-kicker">Optional</p>
      <p class="arch-name">Controller</p>
      <p class="arch-foot">fleet-wide hot keys, versioned policies</p>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-link arch-met" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="arch-line arch-line-out arch-line-dash"><em>metrics</em></span>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-node arch-obs">
      <p class="arch-kicker">Dashboards</p>
      <p class="arch-name">Prometheus + Grafana</p>
      <p class="arch-foot">KeyShift Fleet, KeyShift SDK</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="arch-cap" class="arch-cap">
    <span class="arch-key"><i class="k-req"></i>request path</span>
    <span class="arch-key"><i class="k-ctl"></i>control path</span>
    <span class="arch-cap-text">
      Telemetry carries up to 20 candidate keys per batch, as HMAC fingerprints. Policies can only tighten an instance’s local limits.
    </span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
